The redesign left the build red: MatchCard still imported the removed LiveDot and
carried a dead flash prop, strings.ts defined matches.myTeams twice in both
catalogs, Profile imported unused i18n string types, Table had doubled imports
and no Segmented import, and Matches kept a whole pre-redesign pass of unused
declarations plus dead `{false && ...}` branches eslint rejects. Removes those,
drops the stale root scratch copy that broke parsing, and fixes the Farsi date
strip, which built a Farsi day key instead of reading the catalog key.

